+    '> NOTE: All of the above are concepts and structural descriptions. For actual current values of GDP, inflation, fiscal deficit, debt/GDP, current account, and reserves, consult CAPMAS, CBE statistical bulletins, the Ministry of Finance, or IMF Article IV reports.',
+  ].join('\n'),
+
+  [EgyptEconomyTopic.SovereignCredit]: [
+    '## Egypt Sovereign Credit Assessment',
+    '',
+    '### Rating-agency framework',
