+      '- If an input is missing, ask for it or state the assumption explicitly. Never silently substitute a plausible number.',
+      '- IRR is not a return. It assumes reinvestment at the IRR. Always compare it against the actual hurdle rate.',
+      '- For credit recommendations, cite the DSCR band the tool returned rather than inventing a threshold.',
+      '- For covenant testing, cite the breach periods the tool returned. Never invent a threshold — use the dscr_min and leverage_max the user supplied.',
+      '- For EGP/FX discounting, state the FX path and discount rates used. Never assume a live EGP/USD rate — require the user to supply fx_path explicitly.',
+    ].join('\n');
+  }
+}
